      "quote": "plus acetazolamide after noting the sulfonamide allergy",
      "status": "covered"
    },
    "item_3": {
      "quote": "so the chlorphenamine should be stopped",
      "status": "covered"
    },
    "item_4": {
      "quote": "I would give analgesia and an antiemetic",
      "status": "covered"
    },
    "item_5": {
